{"id":"659768","name":"黄皮鸡翅","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659768/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡中翅","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄皮","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡中翅洗净擦干水份。","img":"images/659768/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入蚝油，生抽，老抽，花生油。","img":"images/659768/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"抓匀腌制半小时以上入味。","img":"images/659768/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"黄皮用盐水泡洗干净。","img":"images/659768/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中热油放入鸡翅。","img":"images/659768/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/659768/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煎好的鸡翅倒入锅中。","img":"images/659768/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽。","img":"images/659768/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入去籽后的黄皮。","img":"images/659768/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量清水和冰糖。","img":"images/659768/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大火煮开后将鸡翅焖15分钟左右。","img":"images/659768/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最后收汁出锅即可。","img":"images/659768/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659768/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659768/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659768/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659768/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}